    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im a parent of a 7yo and we've been seeing a lot of stuff in the news lately about gender identity and using different pronouns. how do i explain all this to my kid in a way that's age appropriate and actually the correct way to handle it? i want to make sure i'm teaching them the right values.",
